cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "cd" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'cd: Climate Departure Analysis from ERA5-Land Reanalysis'
version: 0.5.5
doi: 10.32614/CRAN.package.cd
abstract: Compute climate anomalies from ERA5-Land reanalysis data for custom areas
  of interest. Producer functions download ERA5-Land monthly means, derive variables
  (VPD, RH, soil moisture), and publish Cloud-Optimized GeoTIFFs with a static STAC
  catalog. Consumer functions query the catalog, crop to AOI, compute baselines and
  anomalies for arbitrary reference periods, and run trend analysis (Mann-Kendall
  and Theil-Sen).
